    "text": "Let for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;Then area bounded by the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> and the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____ ."
  },
